# Cloudflare Pages redirects for the customer dashboard.
#
# 2026-07-02 — account-portal redesign (slice 2). The operational
# surfaces moved to the Driftstack desktop app; their web routes are
# retired. Bookmarked links land on the dashboard home (which carries
# the "Get the app" funnel) instead of a 404. 302 (temporary) so
# nothing is permanently cached — the paths could be repurposed later.
# The splat rules also cover retired nested routes.
/profiles          /   302
/snapshots         /   302
/sessions          /   302
/agent-sessions    /   302
/agent-sessions/*  /   302
/recipes           /   302
/recipes/*         /   302
/proxies           /   302
/first-session     /   302
# 2026-07-02 (slice 3.3) — /subscription merged into /billing.
/subscription      /billing   302
